@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-06  Student self-deactivation and return
' Requirements: ACC-17 ACC-18 DATA-01 NOTICE-01 NOTICE-02
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Student" as U
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
actor "Administrator" as A
U -> S: Request deactivation and confirm password
alt Password confirmation fails
  S --> U: Refuse action; keep account state
else Password confirmed
  S --> U: Confirm deactivation and end sessions
  note over S
  Block learning access.
  Preserve profile, attempts, progress,
  completed courses, and badges.
  end note
  ... Student later requests return ...
  note over U,A
  Administrator checks current enrollment again.
  end note
  A -> S: Approve verified Student reactivation
  S --> U: Notify reactivation; allow sign-in and learning
end
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-06 | Product behavior
@enduml
